{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","title":"Naming and linking","desc":"Note names become URLs, so name for permanence and link with wikilinks.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta","urls"],"custom":{},"fname":"notes.naming-and-linking","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"9801f53f03ce1fa514ddc7a841c91b4d","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.naming-and-linking","id":"7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.naming-and-linking","id":"7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.urls","alias":"urls","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.urls"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.three-kinds-of-page","id":"b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":11,"offset":729},"end":{"line":19,"column":58,"offset":776},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.naming-and-linking"},{"from":{"fname":"topics.how-this-notebook-works","id":"b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":3,"offset":386},"end":{"line":10,"column":50,"offset":433},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.naming-and-linking"}],"anchors":{"no-date-prefixes-on-notes":{"type":"header","text":"No date prefixes on notes","value":"no-date-prefixes-on-notes","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"link-with-wikilinks":{"type":"header","text":"Link with wikilinks","value":"link-with-wikilinks","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"naming-and-linking\">Naming and linking<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#naming-and-linking\"></a></h1>\n<p>A file named <code>notes.naming-and-linking.md</code> publishes at\n<code>/notes/naming-and-linking</code>. The filename is the hierarchy path is the\nidentity, so renaming a note changes every link into it — Dendron will offer\nto fix references automatically when you rename through the lookup panel,\nbut it's still worth choosing the slug deliberately once.</p>\n<p>Hierarchy segments are lowercase and hyphenated:\n<code>notes.naming-and-linking</code>, not <code>Notes.NamingAndLinking</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"no-date-prefixes-on-notes\">No date prefixes on notes<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#no-date-prefixes-on-notes\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dated names suit a journal, where the date is the identity. These notes get\nrevised, so a date in the name is a lie within a month. Dates live in the\n<code>created</code> and <code>updated</code> frontmatter instead, which Dendron manages for you.</p>\n<h2 id=\"link-with-wikilinks\">Link with wikilinks<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#link-with-wikilinks\"></a></h2>\n<p><code>[[Three kinds of page|notes.three-kinds-of-page]]</code> renders as a normal link\nand registers in Dendron's link graph. Backlinks and the graph view come\nfree — nothing to maintain by hand.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">urls (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25\">Three kinds of page, and one rule for choosing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc\">How this notebook works</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","title":